      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Set your key in **ComfyUI menu → Extensions → OpenRouter → OpenRouter settings**.\n2. Upload two photos in **Product Photo (Front)** and **Product Photo (Detail)**.\n3. Choose the spec sheet, a PDF or text file in ComfyUI's input folder, in **Spec Sheet**.\n4. Press **Run**. The listing is saved as JSON under `listings/approved` or `listings/review`."
      ],
      "title": "Start Here"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "pos": [
        650,
        30
      ],
      "size": [
        620,
        118
